                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1641.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sullivan to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-05T17:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 5, 1914, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President Jiménez was sworn in this morning.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
